<article>
<div class="_backdrop header">
<header class="_pic-header">
<h1>People restricted in their freedom are treated badly</h1>
<div class="single-hue-pic-wrapper">
<div class="single-hue-pic">
<img src="https://cdn.nuasite.com/assets/ochrance-web-lj8h86/media/potrebuji-pomoc-en/omezeni-na-svobode/DET-23.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true">
